  "worked_solution": "To find every subset of $T,$ we list out every combination of elements within $T.$ \n\nWe can use the following diagram to visualize the process:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038640/assets/03bdaa1b1033d662675e8b594fbc6ed2376b43dd71e28af7a8bf61d1ff17a012.png)\n\nNote that we must include the empty set since it is a subset of every set.\n\nBy doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\u2205,{-1},{0},{1},{-1,0},{-1,1},{0,1},{-1,0,1}.\n$$",
